{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Brave New World of the Internet", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Oops!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Asking for Help or Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " There are several ways to ask for help in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this.  Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "   You can use the structure:<br/>  <span class=\"strong\">Can</span>/ <span class=\"strong\">Could</span>/ <span class=\"strong\">Do</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">you</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">verb</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">me (optional)</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">question word</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">Can you show me how this computer works?<br/> Could you tell me where I can find reliable information?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also suggest advice by using the same structure:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Do you know where to go online for the best  information?<br/> Do you know what to look for when you check a website's accuracy?<br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " These questions suggest solutions related to technical issues.  They are often used in user manuals or troubleshooting booklets.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can/Could/Do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(me)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Question word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> what</span> time it is, please?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> how</span> to use this?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"know\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> how</span> to make sure it's accurate?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"know\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> where</span> to look for reliable information online?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can also use the structure<br/>  <span class=\"strong\">Let me show/tell</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">you</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">question word</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">Let me show you how to make this computer work.<br/> Let me show you where you can find reliable information.<br/> Let me tell you what you should do.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Discussing How to Deal With Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "One way to discuss how to deal with problems is to say what you would do if you were in someone else's situation. It is particularly useful if you want to discuss a complicated technical problem.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " If you write an article about solving issues, you can use modals like <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, <span class=\"italic\"> should</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to suggest solutions and offer assistance. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">I would ... </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I wouldn't ... </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">You could ... </span><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You can also use  <span class=\"italic\">must</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">might want to</span>  or Imperatives to strongly suggest a solution.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">You might want to ... <br/> You must ...<br/> Always check ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These are examples of Sally giving suggestions about how to deal with technical problems. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Using trustworthy search engines may help you find what you really need.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should bear in mind the quality control of what is posted online. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You could also check any links posted on the site to see if they are relevant and updated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Always make sure that there are no broken links.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You might want to avoid this kind of website.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "An unreliable website is unlikely to be a source you would want to use.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "quality control", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a process of testing a product to maintain high standards", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should bear in mind the quality control of what is posted online.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about the quality of the websites you visit every day.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to oversee", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be responsible for; to be in charge of", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Legitimate sites should have someone overseeing the content.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "link", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a word or phrase you can click to visit a specific webpage", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Always make sure that there are no broken links. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "updated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "being up-to-date", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should see if the links are relevant and updated. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "maintenance", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the process of keeping something functional and in good condition", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Broken links are proof of a website's poor maintenance.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wealth ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "large amount; abundance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Despite the wealth of information available, the Internet is not always a reliable library.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "comprehensive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "complete; including nearly all elements of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Despite the wealth of information available, the Internet is not a comprehensive library.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "search engine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an online tool that allows you to search for information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Using trustworthy search engines may help you find what you really need.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of 5 kinds of electronic devices or gadgets that people use every day.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short description for each of them. Explain what they do and if they are useful to complete everyday tasks.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write your opinion on these gadgets. Say if you think they are useful or if people are too dependent on them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your description aloud to your partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask questions about your partner's description.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about technology and gadgets.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions about technological problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I identify different uses of technology in everyday life.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le10ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Do you know where to go when you need a reliable online source?  The process of finding content has changed considerably in the age of the Internet. We must also recognize that despite the wealth of information available, it's not a comprehensive library. Using trustworthy search engines may help you find what you really need."}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "21500", "id": 2, "text": "You should bear in mind the quality control of what is posted online. Do you know how to make sure that what you read is accurate?  Do you know what to look for when you want to check a website's accuracy? Legitimate sites should have someone overseeing the content, or at least have experts review the material before it is uploaded on the Internet."}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob07re2img03.jpg", "time": "43000", "id": 3, "text": "You could also check any links posted on the site to see if they are relevant and updated. Always make sure that there are no broken links. This is something that attests to poor site maintenance, and you might want to avoid this kind of website. In addition, a website that contains spelling or grammatical errors or inaccurate content is unlikely to be a source you would want to use."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le10ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le10ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for help or advice. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How much do you rely on the Internet for your daily tasks and needs?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think people have become too dependent on technology in their daily life? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Would they know what to do if the Internet went down?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Oops! There is no Internet connection! Do you know what to do?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nSally gives a few <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">pointers</span> on how to find the best information online.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"Pointers\"</span> are useful tips.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Click on